## 2. How Cyber-Physical & Industrial Safety Containment Works

1. **Sensor, Telemetry & Command Intake (`[100]`):** Collects physical sensor readings, PLC/HMI states, and operator/automation commands across OT zones and conduits.
2. **Deterministic Boundary & Safety Interlock Checks (`[200]` / `[500c]`):** Enforces zone-and-conduit segmentation, data diodes/firewalls, firmware integrity baselines, and independent Safety Instrumented System (SIS) limit checks before physical actuation can affect equipment, people, or processes.
